            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In illā silvā latrōcinia crēbra erant. In that forest robberies were frequent."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter, from latrō (taught), 'bandit'. Cicero calls a lawless war a latrōcinium."
            }
          ]
        },
